Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:22:57 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 23/39] inputmethod: allow hiding ime back button and drop
 empty ime nav bar

add a secure setting to hide the ime back (dismiss) button in the ime
navigation bar. when the back button is hidden and no other buttons
(such as the ime switcher) are visible, avoid drawing the empty ime
navigation bar and adjust the caption bar insets accordingly.
---
